  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Haapsalu Env. project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">VA-projekt,  Haapsalu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Haapsalu is a coastal city with approximately 15 000 inhabitants. Sida has financed parts of the new wastewater treatment plant as well as a twinning cooperation between the companies Haapsalu Water and Haninge Water. A total investment of 6.2 MUSD for improved wastewater services has been made, of which 16 MSEK from Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Haapsalu &#xe4;r en kuststad med ca 15 000 inv&#xe5;nare vid den k&#xe4;nsliga Haapsalu-viken, d&#xe4;r tidigare orenat avloppsvatten sl&#xe4;pptes ut. Sida har finansierat en del av det nya avloppsreningsverket och ett samarbete mellan VA-verken i Haapsalu och i Haninge kommun. Totalt har6,2 MUSD investerats i f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad VA-service varav 16 MSEK fr&#xe5;n Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
